# .easignore replaces .gitignore for the EAS upload archive.
# The patterns above are unchanged. Several of them were saved with
# underscores in place of asterisks, so they do not match real files.
# The patterns below are what keep credentials out of the archive.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.mobileprovision
*-adminsdk*.json
eas-build.json
eas-submit.json
